	)
	(text "SERVICE HEADER LOGICAL PIN MAP\n1 GND • 2 +3V3 probe • 3 hardware-fault probe • 4 shaped Present\n5 ADC analogue in • 6 Return limited • 7 Return feed\n8 Absence influence • 9 wet mix • 10 GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 45.72 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7d3284c9-42af-4287-8bc3-bde7b95de3c1")
	)
	(text "PROBE-ISOLATION CONTRACT\n+3V3 uses 1 kΩ: accidental ground short is limited to about 3.3 mA.\nHARDWARE_FAULT_N uses 47 kΩ so service access cannot strongly drive the safety net.\nAnalogue probes use 22 kΩ; a 10 MΩ instrument adds under 0.22% loading."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 157.48 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
		)
		(uuid "6238c780-f777-44d8-b084-16f9ec627869")
	)
	(text "BOUNDARY\nAll eight hierarchy signals are read-only inputs. No hierarchy output is created.\nSERVICE_TEST, RESET_CLEAR and SAFE_MUTE remain operating inputs between sheets 08 and 02.\nSWD remains on sheet 02. Power-branch current links remain a later sheet-01 physical gate.\nJ90 is a logical header/pad grouping only; connector, fixture and footprint are not accepted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 223.52 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
		)
